                        "text": "Due to which insurance principle did Mr. Jashim receive less compensation than the full value of the property? Explain.",
                        "answer": "Data: The bike was insured for 2 lakh BDT, but he only received 1 lakh BDT. <br> Analysis: According to the 'Principle of Indemnity', the insurer pays only the 'actual loss' suffered, not the sum insured, to prevent the insured from profiting. <br> Conclusion: He received less due to the 'Principle of Indemnity'."
