                "stem": "Mr. Sujon and Mr. Subel are two brothers. Dreaming of financial prosperity for their family, both of them moved abroad for ten years. Thinking about the future, Mr. Sujon and Mr. Subel took out insurance policies. According to the contract, Mr. Sujon's children can apply for the insurance claim upon his death. On the other hand, even if Mr. Subel does not die, he will receive the insurance claim at the end of the specified period.",
