                "id": "fin2-ch11-cq-060",
                "stem": "Various types of accidents often occur in Jishan Garments factory. The workers of that factory have been protesting for financial security. Accepting their protest, the management took out an insurance policy for the welfare of all working workers. Suddenly, one worker died and seven workers were injured in an accident. The owner of Jishan Garments has submitted an insurance claim to the insurance company on behalf of the deceased and injured workers.",
