                "category": "Comprehension",
                "question": "What is meant by surrender value (সমর্পণ মূল্য)?",
                "answer": "Concept: Surrender value (সমর্পণ মূল্য) is the cash value that an insurance company pays to a policyholder if they decide to terminate or cancel their life insurance policy before its maturity date.\n\n\nExplanation: Since life insurance policies often have a savings component, premiums paid over time accumulate into a \"cash value.\" If the policyholder stops paying premiums or cancels early, the insurer calculates this accumulated amount, deducts any administrative fees or penalties, and pays the remaining balance to the policyholder."
