                "category": "Comprehension",
                "question": "Explain why 'Insurance is a joint system of risk distribution'.",
                "answer": "Concept: Insurance is based on the \"Principle of Risk Pooling\" (ঝুঁকির বণ্টন).\n\n\nExplanation: It is a collective effort where many people exposed to similar risks pay small premiums into a common fund. This fund is used to compensate the few members who actually suffer a loss. By spreading the burden of one person's loss across a large group, insurance transforms a catastrophic individual risk into a manageable collective cost."
