                    "text": "The characteristics of Rajputi fish are—\n\n\n\n<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n(i) Bright and silvery-white color<br>\n(ii) Rapid growth rate<br>\n(iii) Stripped/barred patterns on its back\n</p>\n\nWhich of the following is correct?",
