                    "text": "Read the following stem and answer the question:\n\nAbid and his friends went on an educational excursion to a mangrove forest located spanning across Khulna, Satkhira, Bagerhat, and Barguna districts.\n\nQ. What are the core characteristics of the forest visited during their educational excursion?\n\n\n\n<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">\n(i) Soil and water are saline<br>\n(ii) Pneumatophores (breathing roots) are absent<br>\n(iii) Viviparous germination occurs\n</p>\n\nWhich of the following is correct?",
