                "text": "<p>X, Y, and Z are three partners. The net profit of the business is 30,000 TK. If they distribute profits according to shares of $\\frac{1}{2}$, $\\frac{1}{3}$, and $\\frac{1}{6}$ respectively, how much will Z receive?</p>",
