                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>Oni, Boni, and Joni each started a partnership firm with a capital of 2,00,000 TK. At the end of the year, their net profit stood at 72,000 TK. The profit and loss sharing ratio of the business is 3 : 2 : 1.</p><p>Q. What is the closing capital balance of Oni?</p>",
                "meta": "Sylhet Board · 2024",
