                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>A and B are two partners in a business. Their opening capitals were 60,000 TK and 50,000 TK respectively. A does not participate in the active management of the business.</p><p>Q. If the interest rate is 10%, what is the total interest on capital for the firm?</p>",
