                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>Sohag, Jamal, and Kamal are three partners in a partnership business. On January 1, 2023, their capital balances were 80,000 TK, 60,000 TK, and 40,000 TK respectively. According to the agreement, interest on capital is to be charged at 5%. In the middle of the year, Jamal introduced 20,000 TK as additional capital. The net profit of the business in 2023 was 50,000 TK.</p><p>Q. What is the interest on Jamal's capital?</p>",
