                "explanation": "<p>Since the verbal agreement is silent about the exact loan interest rate, the statutory rate of 6% applies. The loan was brought in the middle of the year (6 months).<br><br>Interest on Loan = $30,000 \\times 6\\% \\times \\frac{6}{12} = 900$ TK.</p>"
