                "text": "Bonus shares are issued to—<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">i. Existing shareholders<br>ii. Future shareholders<br>iii. Instead of cash dividends\n\nWhich of the following is correct?</p>",
