                "text": "A joint-stock company—<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">i. Raises capital through the sale of shares<br>ii. Can enter into any financial transaction like a natural person<br>iii. Can only be dissolved through a legal process\n\nWhich of the following is correct?</p>",
