                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>Meghna Co. Ltd. was registered with 7,500,000 shares of 10 TK each. It issued 4,00,000 shares at 12 TK each for public sale. The company received applications for 50,000 shares more than the issued shares.</p><p>Q. How much total money did the company receive from share applications?</p>",
