                "correctAnswer": 2,
                "explanation": "<p>Advance subscription for the next year reduces current year income, so it is deducted from subscriptions on the credit side of the Income & Expenditure account (ii). Simultaneously, it represents unearned income, which must be reported on the liability side of the closing balance sheet (iii). Thus, ii and iii are correct.</p>"
