                "text": "<p>Mr. Enamul Kabir is a lawyer. His Receipt and Payment Account shows opening cash balance of 1,800 TK, opening bank balance of 6,300 TK, 6 months' interest received on 10% fixed deposit of 500 TK, and payment of outstanding expense of 9000 TK.</p><p>Q. What is the capital fund of Mr. Kabir?</p>",
