                "text": "Which of the following components help in determining the profit or loss, shareholders' equity, and the financial status of assets and liabilities of a business?<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">i. Statement of Financial Position<br>ii. Comprehensive Income Statement<br>iii. Cash Flow Statement\n\nWhich of the following is correct?</p>",
