                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>Total sales of Himel Company Ltd. are 2,00,000 TK, opening stock is 50,000 TK, purchases are 1,20,000 TK, and closing stock is 40,000 TK.</p><p>Q. An increase in which type of expense directly causes a decrease in Net Income without changing Gross Profit?</p>",
