                "id": 8462,
                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>The following information is taken from the accounting logs of 'X' Ltd.: Purchases: 1,80,000 TK; Sales: 3,00,000 TK; Opening Stock: 30,000 TK; Closing Stock: 2,000 TK; Purchase Discount: 2,000 TK; and Sales Returns: 7,000 TK.</p><p>Q. What is the Net Purchases of 'X' Ltd.?</p>",
