                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>Shapla Ltd. purchased a machine for 5,00,000 TK at the beginning of the year. Its installation cost of 10,000 TK is incorrectly included within the wages account. The total wages paid were 40,000 TK. It is decided to charge depreciation at a rate of 10% on the machine.</p><p>Q. What is the depreciation expense of the machine for the relevant year?</p>",
