                "text": "<p>The total sales of Karim Co. Ltd. are 16,00,000 TK. Sales returns are 1,40,000 TK, sales discounts are 1,10,000 TK, gross profit is 5,00,000 TK, and net profit is 2,50,000 TK. What is the Gross Profit Ratio of the company?</p>",
