                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>The financial logs of Kabir Ltd. as of December 31, 2023, state: Total Sales: 5,30,000 TK; Sales Returns: 20,000 TK; Sales Discounts: 10,000 TK; and Cost of Goods Sold: 3,75,000 TK.</p><p>Q. What is the Gross Profit Margin percentage?</p>",
