                "text": "Read the following stem and answer the question:\n\nThe financial logs of Kabir Ltd. as of December 31, 2023, state: Total Sales: 5,30,000 TK; Sales Returns: 20,000 TK; Sales Discounts: 10,000 TK; and Cost of Goods Sold: 3,75,000 TK.\n\nQ. If the net sales revenue drops to 4,50,000 TK while costs remain unchanged, what will happen?<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">i. Gross profit will increase<br>ii. Gross profit will decrease<br>iii. Owners' equity will decrease\n\nWhich of the following is correct?</p>",
