                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>At Ahad Jute Mills, the standard weekly working hours are 48 hours. Suman is a laborer there. During the first week of January, he worked for 60 hours. The normal wage rate is 30 TK per hour. Overtime is paid at twice the normal wage rate. He receives a house rent allowance of 50% of his basic wage and contributes 5% to the welfare fund.</p><p>Q. What is Suman's normal/basic wage?</p>",
