                "explanation": "<p>Suman's normal wage is calculated based on the standard hours of the week, regardless of total hours worked.<br><br>$\\text{Normal Weekly Wage} = \\text{Standard Hours} \\times \\text{Normal Hourly Rate}$<br><br>$\\text{Normal Wage} = 48 \\text{ hours} \\times 30\\text{ TK} = 1,440\\text{ TK}$.</p>"
