                "explanation": "<p>1. Prime Cost = Raw Materials Consumed + Direct Expenses + Direct Wages<br><br>$2,10,000 = 1,20,000 + 25,000 + \\text{Direct Wages} \\implies 2,10,000 = 1,45,000 + \\text{Direct Wages}$<br><br>$\\text{Direct Wages} = 2,10,000 - 1,45,000 = 65,000\\text{ TK}$.<br><br>2. Factory Overhead = 40% of Direct Wages = $40\\% \\times 65,000 = 26,000\\text{ TK}$.</p>"
