                "text": "<p>If Factory Cost is 1,40,000 TK, Selling Overhead is 10,000 TK, Net Profit is 40,000 TK, and total Sales are 2,00,000 TK, what is the amount of Office & Administrative Overhead?</p>",
                "meta": "Chittagong Board · 2024",
