                "id": 8694,
                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>On March 1, 2023, Mr. Akash purchased 200 units of a product @ 20 TK per unit. On March 7, he purchased 300 units @ 30 TK per unit. On March 31, he issued 250 units.</p><p>Q. What is the unit cost price of the inventory under the Weighted Average Method?</p>",
                "meta": "Sylhet Board · 2024",
                "type": "board",
