                "text": "Which of the following terms relate to shipping and freight transportation conditions?<p class=\"ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">i. FOB Shipping Point<br>ii. 2/EOM<br>iii. FOB Destination\n\nWhich of the following is correct?</p>",
