                "id": 8870,
                "text": "<p>Read the following stem and answer the question:</p><p>The following data are taken from Tahsin Ltd.:</p><p>Fixed costs: 1,80,000 TK, Variable cost per unit: 20 TK, Selling price per unit: 50 TK, and Annual Sales: 5,00,000 TK.</p><p>Q. What is the amount of break-even sales?</p>",
