                "explanation": "<p>All three statements are mathematically correct:<br><br>i. $\\text{Fixed Cost} = \\text{CM} - \\text{Profit}$<br><br>ii. $\\text{Fixed Cost} = \\text{Total Cost} - \\text{Variable Cost}$<br><br>iii. In case of a loss, $\\text{Fixed Cost} = \\text{CM} + \\text{Loss}$.</p>"
