                        "label": "c",
                        "text": "Which management function is performed in position 'ক'? Explain.",
                        "answer": "Position 'ক' represents Planning (পরিকল্পনা).<br>* Definition: It is the primary function of management that involves deciding in advance what is to be done, when, where, how, and by whom.<br>* Foundation: It acts as the blueprint for all other management activities.<br>* Placement: In the management cycle, it is the starting point that follows 'Controlling' from the previous cycle, as seen in the circular arrows of the diagram."
