                "text": "<p>[Stem: Same as above] The reason for the implementation problem is-</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Failure to consider background<br>(ii) Failure to hire qualified staff<br>(iii) Planning based on assumptions and emotions</p>",
