                "id": "26",
                "stem": "Mr. Farhad is the owner of an export-oriented ready-made garment industry. The garments produced in his factory are exported to various countries in Europe. Recently, he received an order to export 100,000 t-shirts from Canada. But due to an electrical malfunction, he failed to complete the production on time. Mr. Raiyan is the owner of \"ABC Garments Industries.\" He exports surplus garments after meeting domestic demand. He supplies garments according to customer orders. He arranges a generator to keep production activities uninterrupted.",
