                        "label": "d",
                        "text": "Analyze the specific aspect of organization that has been emphasized for running the institution smoothly.",
                        "answer": "Cognition: To run the institution smoothly, the specific aspect of organization that has been emphasized is the Chain of Command / Scalar Chain (কমিউনিকেশন বা কর্তৃত্বের শিকল / মই নীতি) and the resulting institutional discipline.<br><br>Explanation: The scalar chain refers to the continuous, unbroken line of authority and communication that links every position from the highest executive to the lowest employee. Emphasizing a rigid chain of command clarifies operational boundaries, defines exact accountability, and ensures that instructions are passed down systematically. This structured flow removes ambiguity, minimizes insubordination, and builds a culture of strict discipline and execution.<br><br>Application: In the case of Grameen Ltd., the linear framework ensures that every employee knows exactly who holds authority over them. The stem states that because specific responsibilities and authorities are explicitly defined, subordinates have no tendency to disobey orders, and nobody slacks off or avoids their duties. This direct correlation between a well-defined line of authority and employee commitment proves that management focuses heavily on maintaining an uninterrupted structural chain.<br><br>Conclusion: In conclusion, the smooth operations at Grameen Ltd. are a direct outcome of emphasizing a strong, transparent scalar chain. By keeping the lines of authority and responsibility completely clear and unidirectional, the organization successfully establishes ironclad discipline, eliminates internal confusion, and achieves optimal operational efficiency across all management layers."
