                        "text": "From which source did Megha Automobiles Ltd. recruit employees in the stem? Explain.",
                        "answer": "Identification: Megha Automobiles Ltd. recruited employees from an External Source, specifically through Educational Institution Recruitment (Campus Recruitment).<br><br>Definition & Linkage: External recruitment refers to the process of hiring qualified talent from outside the current workforce of the enterprise. In the stem, Megha Automobiles Ltd. hired newly graduated engineers directly from the Bangladesh University of Engineering and Technology (BUET) to expand production and improve customer services.<br><br>Analysis: Recruiting fresh talents directly from renowned professional universities is a classic example of external campus recruitment. This approach injects fresh perspectives, modern technical knowledge, and vibrant energy into the company, which aligns perfectly with Megha Automobiles' technical expansion needs."
