                        "answer": "Identification:<br><br>The employees of Karnaphuli Bank are given promotions on the basis of Efficiency/Merit (দক্ষতার ভিত্তিতে পদোন্নতি).<br><br>Theoretical Explanation:<br><br>Promotion based on efficiency or merit is the process of elevating an employee to a higher post with more responsibilities, status, and salary based on their proven skills, performance, and competence rather than their length of service. This system encourages healthy competition among the workforce, rewards high performance, and ensures that capable individuals occupy key managerial positions within the enterprise.<br><br>Contextual Application:<br><br>In the stem, when Karnaphuli Bank Limited expands its business by opening a new branch, it needs reliable human resources to handle operations. To fill the higher responsibilities at this new branch, management evaluates its permanent staff. The text explicitly mentions that promotions were awarded to existing permanent workers based on their \"work efficiency\" (কাজের দক্ষতা). Therefore, the bank follows a strictly merit-based and efficiency-oriented promotion strategy."
