                "text": "<p>The qualities of an ideal leader are-</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Courage and strong morale<br>(ii) Self-centered mindset<br>(iii) Enthusiasm and the power to influence</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
