                "text": "<p>As a result of Laissez-faire (Free-rein) leadership-</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Subordinates enjoy absolute freedom<br>(ii) The leader becomes averse to work/inactive<br>(iii) Productivity increases</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
