                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. M. Rahman is the Managing Director of a software firm. Before taking any institutional decisions, he discusses the matters with the respective subordinates who will implement them. Based on everyone's input, he shapes the final decisions and issues instructions. Q. What type of direction does Mr. M. Rahman provide?</p>",
