                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: The proprietor of Jyoti Enterprise, Mr. Robin, considers the overall well-being and personal problems of his employees to boost production. As a result, workers perform their tasks with high enthusiasm, bringing excellent outcomes for the company. Q. From the behavioral/attitudinal perspective, what type of leadership exists in the stem?</p>",
