                "id": 7363,
                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Afzal is the Managing Director of an organization. He values and incorporates the viewpoints and suggestions of his subordinates when framing choices. This approach infuses dynamism across all organizational activities. Q. What type of leadership is practiced in Mr. Afzal's enterprise?</p>",
