                "id": 7367,
                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Miss Anika is the Chief Executive Officer of 'Shorna Fashion Ltd.' To guide and manage her subordinates, she consults with them, collects their inputs, and issues operational directions based on those discussions. Q. The advantages of Anika's leadership style are-</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Increase in decision quality<br>(ii) Enhancement of interpersonal communication<br>(iii) Creation of disobedience</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
