                "correctAnswer": 3,
                "explanation": "<p>Sound direction must be clear, complete, and reasonable. It must possess flexibility to adjust to changing environment conditions. Rigidity or absolute inflexibility is a severe operational flaw and cannot be a characteristic of good direction.</p>"
