                "stem": "Mr. Nirup manages 30 sales officers across the country as the sales manager of Mahananda Mobile Company. Before giving any direction, he uses an online platform to discuss and consult with them regarding the subject matter of the direction. As a result, the subordinates are satisfied with him.",
