                "text": "<p>Which of the following elements are directly linked to and associated with an individual's personal motivation?</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Felt Need<br>(ii) Emotion<br>(iii) Drive</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
