                "id": 7562,
                "text": "<p>The manager of Ishita & Co. arranges necessary incentives to encourage workers to increase production. In this case, the manager actively considers the workers'—</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Complaints and grievances<br>(ii) Emotions and feelings<br>(iii) Preferences and dislikes</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
