                "text": "<p>Which of the following points represent the direct, positive results of motivating a corporate workforce?</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) High job satisfaction<br>(ii) High morale<br>(iii) Increase in total operational expenses</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
