                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Shanta Ltd. is a ready-made garment factory. Workers here are given regular training. The institution provides transportation facilities for its workers. However, there is an insufficiency of light and air in the workplace. The company distributes a portion of its profits among the workers at the end of the year. Despite the financial gains, the workers remain dissatisfied. Q. What is the primary cause of employee dissatisfaction at Shanta Ltd.?</p>",
