                "id": "06",
                "stem": "Jaya is a regional sales manager of a manufacturing company. She receives an attractive salary, bonuses, and transportation facilities from her organization. Her performance is of quite good quality. Even so, the higher-ranking official keeps pressure on her. She thinks that she is not properly evaluated.",
