                "id": "14",
                "stem": "The manager of 'Nishat' Group forces work out of the employees. He believes that employees dislike work and evade it whenever they get an opportunity. The employees are traditional in nature and do not like changes. For this reason, he does not just sit back after giving work orders; instead, he monitors them constantly to get the work done by any means. This maintains his control over the employees of the organization.",
