                "id": "15",
                "stem": "Mr. Meher is the manager of an industrial enterprise in the Savar Export Processing Zone. He provides all kinds of financial facilities to the employees in his organization. However, they have to work in an unfavorable and unhealthy working environment. Even they are not given any opportunity to express any kind of opinion. As a result, a state of dissatisfaction and anger prevails among the workers in the organization.",
