                "stem": "Mr. Junaid is the manager of an organization. He does not provide an adequate amount of remuneration to his employees. As a result, dissatisfaction has arisen among the workers. By ensuring all financial and non-financial elements, he is interested in increasing the morale of the employees and raising the volume and quality of production through the creation of a proper production environment.",
