                "id": "28",
                "stem": "Mr. Saif, after passing his MBA, is working in a private organization. He completes his work on time. In this case, he does not need to be pressured for work. Sometimes he also provides advice on various matters. For this reason, the owner of the organization provides him with a good working environment as well as leaves at different times. Therefore, Mr. Saif is highly satisfied with his owner.",
