                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Jahangir issued a formal notice to workers at AB Garments in Narayanganj outlining fire prevention protocols. Because the notice contained complex foreign technical terms, the workers could not understand its meaning. Consequently, they failed to put out a localized fire outbreak, causing severe damage to the factory floor. Q. Which communication channel or method did Mr. Jahangir deploy to transmit the message?</p>",
