                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: (Context connected to the vertical organizational chart flows described above). Q. What are the primary outcomes of a well-maintained vertical communication channel?</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Quick execution of structural executive orders<br>(ii) Higher alignment across strategic business units<br>(iii) Immediate reduction of workplace rumors and gossip</p>",
