                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Tetley Ltd. is a major tea manufacturing and marketing enterprise that sells its products locally and internationally. Mr. Kollol serves as the Production Manager, and Mr. Mamun is the Sales Manager. Mr. Kollol systematically provides written data summaries regarding monthly tea production quantities directly to Mr. Mamun. Q. What specific direction of communication is taking place between Mr. Kollol and Mr. Mamun?</p>",
