                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Alam, the Production Manager of Keya Cosmetics Ltd., instructed his team to find out why factory output has dropped. The subordinate workers reported back to Mr. Alam, explaining that a critical machine malfunction was slowing down production. Q. What specific direction of communication is shown when the workers report their findings back up to Mr. Alam?</p>",
