                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Mizan works as a Marketing Manager at ABC Fashion Ltd. Meanwhile, Mr. Robin Ahmed works as an Assistant Production Manager within a separate division of the same company. Q. What type of communication occurs when these two individuals from different departments and different hierarchy ranks interact?</p>",
