                "id": 7682,
                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Abul Kalam is the Managing Director of Star Publications. The company's Marketing Manager, Mo. Saikat Hossain, inspected various libraries across the Rajshahi region and prepared a detailed field report, which he sent to the Managing Director via a fax machine. Q. What direction of communication was established within Star Publications when the manager sent his report to the director?</p>",
