                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: Mr. Karim is the Sales Manager of X Firm. He submitted a formal requisition letter to the General Manager asking to hire one Assistant Sales Manager and five sales representatives for his team. The General Manager reviewed it and ordered the Human Resource (HR) Manager to take action. Q. What broad structural category of communication is illustrated by these multi-tiered exchanges?</p>",
