                "text": "<p>Read the stem and answer the question: An enterprise sets a target weekly production volume of 50,000 units. However, at the end of the week, the actual production volume is 45,000 units. The management takes necessary measures to ensure this variance does not happen again. Q. To hit the company's targets, what corrective actions should management take?</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) Setting more accurate targets<br>(ii) Organizing training programs for employees<br>(iii) Ensuring proper and close supervision</p><p>Which of the following is correct?</p>",
