                "text": "<p>Which of the following options represent core features and characteristics of management control?</p><p class='ml-4 my-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400'>(i) It serves as the definitive baseline foundation for future planning<br>(ii) It operates as an ongoing, continuous process across cycles<br>(iii) It exerts its influence across all hierarchical levels of an enterprise</p>",
