                                "stem": "Sylhet Gas Fields Limited is supplying gas to chemical fertilizer and power generation plants at a lower price without prioritizing profit, which is playing a vital role in the country's economic development. On the other hand, to strengthen the economic foundation further, the government is engaging private enterprises alongside the government in infrastructural construction. As a result, both the government and private enterprises are benefiting. This new business concept is currently becoming popular in various countries of the world.",
