                                        "answer": "By registering his novel, Mr. Kalam acquired the \"Copyright\" (স্বত্বাধিকার) over his literary work.<br><br>Explanation: Under the Copyright Act, an author who registers their original work gets exclusive legal rights over it. This includes the right to reproduce, publish, perform, or adapt the work, and the legal standing to take action against anyone who infringes upon these rights by publishing it without permission."
