                                                                "text": "What is meant by the SME Foundation? Explain.",
                                                                "answer": "The SME Foundation is a non-profit pan-governmental organization in Bangladesh established to foster the growth and development of Small and Medium Enterprises. It operates as the core driving force for macro-economic development by offering non-financial and financial assistance to small-scale industries.<br><br>Its primary activities include expanding entrepreneurship development programs, providing skill-based training, matching market linkups, and facilitating low-interest, soft-term credit lines for micro-entrepreneurs, particularly prioritizing women."
